SentinelOne|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/sentinelone|sentinelone|s1-agent
Microsoft Defender for Endpoint|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/microsoft/mdatp|wdavdaemon
Palo Alto Cortex XDR|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/traps /etc/panw|
Carbon Black|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/carbonblack /var/opt/carbonblack|cbagentd
Sophos|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/sophos-spl /opt/sophos-av|
Elastic Defend|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/Elastic|elastic-endpoint|elastic-agent
Trend Micro|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/ds_agent /opt/TrendMicro|
Trellix (McAfee)|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/McAfee /opt/isec /opt/Trellix|
Cybereason|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/cybereason|
Cisco Secure Endpoint|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/cisco/amp|
Bitdefender GravityZone|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/bitdefender-security-tools|
ESET|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/eset|
Kaspersky Endpoint Security|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/kaspersky|
WithSecure|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/f-secure /opt/withsecure|
Uptycs|endpoint security: reads files|/opt/uptycs|
Velociraptor|forensics agent: reads files|/opt/velociraptor|velociraptor
